# This project keeps configuration next to each service:
#   server/.env.example      -> server/.env      (Express API, MongoDB, JWT, Power BI)
#   ai-service/.env.example  -> ai-service/.env  (model selection, thresholds, storage)
# The client needs no environment file in development (Vite proxies /api to :4000).
#
# Variables used only by docker-compose.yml:
AI_SERVICE_TOKEN=change-me-to-a-long-random-value
JWT_ACCESS_SECRET=change-me-48-random-bytes
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=change-me-another-48-random-bytes
